Replies:
**lisa implementation guidance:** fix (cheap): on the D18 403 in save(), emit an info-level audit record in the PEP's 'authz decision' shape (audit=true, decision=deny, subject, resource agent + id, action configure, reason with the first non-policy path from the diff via a new agentconfig.FirstNonPolicyPath). Add a Cedar policy-author revert integration test that crosses non-policy fields (403, no new revision).

